flowchart TD
    ISSUE[playback problem] --> WHY{category}
    WHY -->|state drift| SESSION[MediaSession is single truth - all surfaces observe]
    WHY -->|stops in background/rotation| SERVICE[player in MediaSessionService - Ch 46]
    WHY -->|position lost| PERSIST[save to SSOT + restore - Ch 3/8]
    WHY -->|focus/noisy| AUDIO[audio focus + becoming-noisy handling]
    WHY -->|battery| RELEASE[release player when done]
